Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,chapter,0,0,0,sync,{OP}
Comment: 0,0:00:12.42,0:00:13.76,OP2 - ENG,nowarp,0,0,0,karaoke,The rapids still beat against me
Comment: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:15.56,OP2 - ENG,nowarp,0,0,0,karaoke,The bottom so distant it's pitch black
Comment: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:16.62,OP2 - ENG,nowarp,0,0,0,karaoke,You've gotta be kidding me
Comment: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:17.36,OP2 - ENG,nowarp,0,0,0,karaoke,Hey, who do you think you are?
Comment: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:19.00,OP2 - ENG,nowarp,0,0,0,karaoke,Quit toying with me
Comment: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:20.81,OP2 - ENG,nowarp,0,0,0,karaoke,Before time itself loses the battle with darkness!
Comment: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:22.61,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,You may get fired up, but do take care
Comment: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:25.12,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,For the mask of evil sometimes conceals righteousness
Comment: 0,0:00:25.17,0:00:27.59,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,On the contrary, if you don't show it for what it is
Comment: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:29.76,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,You'll never get your arguments in order
Comment: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:31.60,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,A voice sobbing in the absence of mercy
Comment: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:33.40,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,Powerless feet freezing still
Comment: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:35.68,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,In the future, those things will only serve to hold you down
Comment: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:36.80,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,So better keep your eyes open
Comment: 0,0:00:36.84,0:00:38.65,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,"Things are fine this way," and "I wanna live"
Comment: 0,0:00:38.65,0:00:41.65,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,These thoughts won't do you any good if you merely wish for 'em
Comment: 0,0:00:41.65,0:00:44.02,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,Don't just mumble such important phrases
Comment: 0,0:00:44.06,0:00:45.85,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,Or you'll turn the whole story to trash
Comment: 0,0:00:45.85,0:00:48.27,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,Fly high and sure—Phantom’s begun!
Comment: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:50.50,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,A mirage of dazzling brilliance
Comment: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:52.90,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,A mirage that stirs the very heart
Comment: 0,0:00:52.90,0:00:56.28,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,There's no point in trying to deliberate between light and dark
Comment: 0,0:00:56.32,0:00:58.31,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,Even if everything's lost and gone
Comment: 0,0:00:58.31,0:01:00.41,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,Smile as though it were still all there
Comment: 0,0:01:00.54,0:01:02.51,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,But there's one thing I hope you won't forget
Comment: 0,0:01:02.51,0:01:04.90,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,'Cause our journey's still far from over
Comment: 0,0:01:04.90,0:01:07.30,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,It'll never end until you agree
Comment: 0,0:01:07.30,0:01:10.21,OP2 - ENG,warping,0,0,0,karaoke,That we're gonna see what lies beyond this sky
Comment: 0,0:01:10.34,0:01:14.97,OP2 - ENG,nowarp,0,0,0,karaoke,Cut through that spiderweb of terror trying to wind around us
Comment: 0,0:01:15.13,0:01:18.40,OP2 - ENG,nowarp,0,0,0,karaoke,It's time to prove we've got the stuff to get stronger
Comment: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:20.97,OP2 - ENG,nowarp,0,0,0,karaoke,With a sorrowful, but still eternal
Comment: 0,0:01:21.10,0:01:24.02,OP2 - ENG,nowarp,0,0,0,karaoke,"I'll always have love to give"
Comment: 0,0:01:24.10,0:01:25.56,OP2 - ENG,commandspell,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k16}{\k15}I’ll {\k15}ne{\k15}ver {\k30}catch {\k15}bad {\k27}fate{\k13}
